# Migration corpus: 149 MB of the owner's REAL artwork, decompressed from
# server/src/data/backups/*.gz by task 07. Deliberately NOT committed (owner
# decision, 2026-08-16) -- the repo's whole history is ~8 MB and git history is
# effectively permanent.
#
# The committed SHA-256 digest snapshots in
# client/src/types/__tests__/__snapshots__/ ARE the regression gate. Regenerate
# the corpus locally from the backups to run the corpus suites; see
# client/src/test/__fixtures__/corpus/README.md.
